## 题解

```java
int n = sc.nextInt();
int[] a = new int[n];
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) a[i] = sc.nextInt();
int mx = a[0];
for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) if (a[i] > mx) mx = a[i];
System.out.println(mx);
```
